          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lino amubone! Mwami ulabapazizya maanzi aamulonga, amaanzi manji aali anguzu, nkukuti mwami wa-Asuri abulemu bwakwe boonse. Ulapayila mafolo aawo oonse akusotoka myuuma yawo yoonse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
