        {
          "text": "ulaya bufuta mane kusikila kucisi ca-Juda, Ulapaya akufutisya, ulatana kunsingo. Kutandabala kwamababa aakwe kuyoozuzya nyika yako yoonse, O Imanueli.",
          "type": "text",
