        {
          "text": "Amupyopyongane, nubantu—pele mulapwayigwa. Amuswiilile, nyoonse numuzwa kule. Amulyaange kucibuno—pele mulapwayigwa. Amulyaange kucibuno—pele mulapwayigwa. ",
